{"availability":"available","full":"utkarsh5026/me","name":"me","description":"💻 A VS Code–inspired developer portfolio: 📂 file explorer, 🗂️ draggable tabs, ⌨️ an interactive terminal, 🔍 git blame & commit history panels, 📊 D3 charts and 🎨 Catppuccin themes. ⚛️ Built with React, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS and Zustand. 📱 Installable as a PWA.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":6,"forks":1,"created":"2024-07-02T19:31:55Z","updated":"2026-09-28T15:27:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://utkarsh5026.github.io/me/","topics":["bun","catppuccin","d3js","developer-portfolio","github-pages","personal-website","portfolio","portfolio-website","pwa","react","react-compiler","shadcn-ui","single-page-app","tailwindcss","terminal","typescript","vite","vscode","vscode-inspired","zustand"],"demo":"https://utkarsh5026.github.io/me/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:27.885Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:27.885Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:27.885Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:50.586Z","stars":6,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:18:23.153Z","stars":6,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-16T20:31:57.399Z","stars":6,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-18T13:34:27.885Z","stars":6,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A VS Code–inspired developer portfolio. Built to impress. Crafted to perform.","This is not your average developer portfolio. It's a fully interactive, VS Code–inspired single-page application that reimagines the traditional portfolio format as a living code editor — complete with a file explorer, closeable tabs, an embedded terminal, breadcrumb navigation, and a Git commits panel.","Most portfolios are static pages. This one behaves like an IDE. Every section of the portfolio maps to a \"file\" inside the editor. Visitors navigate the way developers do — through files and tabs — making the experience memorable, immersive, and uniquely on-brand for a software developer."],"features":["🎯 Stands out in a sea of template-based portfolios","🎨 Communicates personality through the UI itself, not just text","⚡ Delivers exceptional performance via code splitting, PWA caching, image optimization, compression, and lazy loading","📱 Works beautifully on both desktop and mobile, with swipe navigation on touch devices","💻 VS Code Editor UI — Authentic file explorer, closeable tabs (close left/right/all), breadcrumbs, status bar, and outline panel. Open tabs are remembered between visits."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/utkarsh5026/me/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9dcb0eceb4a252c485633aa5493573117e5b75906c930fdd190df53e4f4522aa","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:50.858Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:27.998Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A VS Code–inspired developer portfolio. Built to impress. Crafted to perform.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/utkarsh5026/me/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9dcb0eceb4a252c485633aa5493573117e5b75906c930fdd190df53e4f4522aa","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/utkarsh5026/me/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:27.999Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-28T15:27:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/utkarsh5026/me/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:28.000Z","hash":"9dcb0eceb4a252c485633aa5493573117e5b75906c930fdd190df53e4f4522aa","originalBytes":20492,"storedBytes":20492,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:27.885Z","subjects":["Templates & UI components","Portfolios & personal sites","Browser extensions & PWAs","Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Templates & UI components","Portfolios & personal sites","Browser extensions & PWAs","Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Templates & UI components","source":"metadata","match":"themes"},{"subje